    "title": "Texas lawmakers approve letting private citizens sue abortion pill providers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By GEOFF MULVIHILL ,\n3 hours ago Texas lawmakers on Wednesday approved letting private citizens sue abortion pill manufacturers, doctors and anyone who mails the medication, setting the state up to be the first to try to crack down on the most common abortion method. The law would be the first of its kind in the U.S.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
